<h2>CLAUDE.md &mdash; The Instruction File</h2>
<p>Claude Code uses a Markdown file called <code>CLAUDE.md</code> as the file it always refers to. Think of it as <strong>a file that is always included with whatever command you give the AI</strong>. That is why it should hold the important content clearly, <strong>without getting too long</strong>.</p>

